# Private project-management notes and historical metric reports.  The public
# release guide is README.md plus the allow-listed operational docs below.
AGENTS.md
ARCHITECTURE_STATUS.md
BACKLOG.md
COMPETITION_RUNBOOK.md
DATA_ANALYSIS.md
